      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLAKEMORE AVENUE (5) can build on his much better third-up effort at the Sunny Coast, where she also had some trouble getting clear late. Is a three-time winner over this trip and should be at her top now. Bold showing anticipated. ALPHA BRAVO (1) resume and is proven fresh performer. The form around him last campaign reads strongly and he's track specialist. Sure to be very competitive. IRAMA (3) was poor in Saturday company at Doomben, but racing wide throughout gives him some excuse and his prior form measures right up. Thompson's booking is a good push too. GREYZOUS (6) caught the eye fresh when doing her best work late at the Gold Coast. Couldn't pay her supporters last time when sent out fav but was still okay. Gets weight relief and is worth following up.",
